Description: A board for a 'targets' pipeline, to understand it while
    working on it: its structure, what is outdated, what each target
    produced, and what a run is doing. An alternative to
    targets::tar_watch() with more control: from the board, the author can
    start and stop runs, invalidate targets, preview their values, and see
    where errors and warnings came from, with the code to debug them.
